# PLO_LOADGANI (195), part 2: separate ganis per question so one override does not mask the next.
# The client reports every gani change in PLI_PLAYERPROPS (prop 10); 157 is its UPDATEGANI request.
waitsession 240
wait s2c 9 90
sleep 8
mark A server 195 allowed: play lift once (file SETBACKTO carrystill)
s2c 9 c:10 str:lift
sleep 4
mark A2 play kick once (file SETBACKTO idle), server 195 allowed
s2c 9 c:10 str:kick
sleep 4
drop s2c 195
mark B 195 kick SETBACKTO sit after kick is loaded
s2c 195 str:kick hex:225345544241434b544f2073697422
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:kick
sleep 4
mark C 195 kick SETBACKTO idle again (does a later 195 replace the override?)
s2c 195 str:kick hex:225345544241434b544f2069646c6522
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:kick
sleep 4
mark D 195 lift SETBACKTO dead, lift loaded
s2c 195 str:lift hex:225345544241434b544f206465616422
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:lift
sleep 4
mark E 195 hurt unquoted SETBACKTO sit (hurt first use comes after)
s2c 9 c:10 str:hurt
sleep 4
s2c 195 str:hurt t:SETBACKTO_sit
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:hurt
sleep 4
mark F 195 hurt with the field unquoted and a space
s2c 195 str:hurt hex:5345544241434b544f20736974
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:hurt
sleep 4
mark G 195 sword two SETBACKTO fields (which wins?)
s2c 9 c:10 str:sword
sleep 3
s2c 195 str:sword hex:225345544241434b544f20736974222c225345544241434b544f206465616422
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:sword
sleep 4
mark H 195 sword SETBACKTO with no name
s2c 195 str:sword hex:225345544241434b544f2022
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:sword
sleep 4
mark I 195 grab SETBACKTO idle (grab file has no SETBACKTO), before and after its first use
s2c 195 str:grab hex:225345544241434b544f2069646c6522
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:grab
sleep 4
s2c 195 str:grab hex:225345544241434b544f2069646c6522
sleep 1
s2c 9 c:10 str:grab
sleep 4
mark END
sleep 2
